Cell[TextData[{
 "1. This Appendix presents the validation process with Laplace\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s equation for second- and third-order potential gradients \
in Tables A1-A4 and 1-2.\n2. Each of the following sections is independent by \
using the command ",
 StyleBox["Clear[\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Global`*\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " to clear previous arguments.\n3. After running all codes,  the results of \
Laplace\[CloseCurlyQuote]s equation are obtained as zero."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.887167515636952*^9, 3.88716769306709*^9}, {
  3.887167744009897*^9, 3.8871678345962477`*^9}, {3.91077625721524*^9, 
